		"description": "<p>You retain a humanoid body and are capable of speech, but you gain the facial features of your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-heritage-features.Item.tAFCE9HP8lcgHFfJ]{Horse Form}. While in your hybrid form, you gain proficiency with Intimidation, or an expertise die if you were already proficient. When you successfully intimidate a creature, you have advantage on Intimidation checks against that creature for the next 24 hours.</p>",
